    {
      "id": 743,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -3640,
        464
      ],
      "size": [
        1312,
        1480
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 6,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### Chroma final model has been released and is hosted [here](https://huggingface.co/lodestones/Chroma1-HD). You can visit [here](https://huggingface.co/lodestones/Chroma) to get previous versions for download. For other models, if you have used models related to Flux, then you probably don't need to download them again.\n\n<br>\n\n# diffusion_models\n\n### [Chroma1-HD.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/lodestones/Chroma1-HD/resolve/main/Chroma1-HD.safetensors)\n\n## or fp8_scaled version for lower VRAM GPU\n\n### [Chroma1-HD-fp8_scaled_rev2.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/silveroxides/Chroma1-HD-fp8-scaled/resolve/main/Chroma1-HD-fp8_scaled_rev2.safetensors)\n\n<br>\n\n## or fp8_scaled hybrid precision models for better output when using fp8\n\n## They will require this custom node\n\n### [ComfyUI_Hybrid-Scaled_fp8-Loader](https://github.com/silveroxides/ComfyUI_Hybrid-Scaled_fp8-Loader) in order to be loaded properly.\n\n### Large variant must use pruned flash-heun LoRAs while small can use regular ones.\n\n### [Chroma1-HD-fp8_scaled_original_hybrid_small_rev2.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/silveroxides/Chroma1-HD-fp8-scaled/blob/main/Chroma1-HD-fp8_scaled_original_hybrid_small_rev2.safetensors)\n\n### [Chroma1-HD-fp8_scaled_original_hybrid_large_rev2.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/silveroxides/Chroma1-HD-fp8-scaled/blob/main/Chroma1-HD-fp8_scaled_original_hybrid_large_rev2.safetensors)\n\n<br>\n\n\n# text_encoders\n\n\n### [t5xxl_fp16](https://huggingface.co/comfyanonymous/flux_text_encoders/resolve/main/t5xxl_fp16.safetensors) or [t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/comfyanonymous/flux_text_encoders/resolve/main/t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors)\n\n### alternatively [flan-t5-xxl-fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/silveroxides/flan-t5-xxl-encoder-only/blob/main/flan-t5-xxl-fp16.safetensors) or [flan-t5-xxl_float8_e4m3fn_scaled_stochastic.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/silveroxides/flan-t5-xxl-encoder-only/blob/main/flan-t5-xxl_float8_e4m3fn_scaled_stochastic.safetensors)\n\n### recommended flan-t5-xxl for precision: [flan-t5-xxl-Q8_0.gguf](https://huggingface.co/silveroxides/flan-t5-xxl-encoder-only-GGUF/blob/main/flan-t5-xxl-Q8_0.gguf)\n\n### GGUF models will require [ComfyUI-GGUF](https://github.com/city96/ComfyUI-GGUF) in order to load.\n\n<br>\n\n# vae\n\n### [ae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Lumina_Image_2.0_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ae.safetensors)\n\n<br>\n\n```\n\ud83d\udcc2 ComfyUI/\n\u251c\u2500 \ud83d\udcc2 models/\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500 \ud83d\udcc2 diffusion_models/\n\u2502   \u2502     \u251c\u2500\u2500 Chroma1-HD-fp8_scaled_rev2_learned_topp0.25_k16-2688_svd.safetensors\n\u2502   \u2502     \u2514\u2500\u2500 Chroma1-HD.safetensors\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500 \ud83d\udcc2 text_encoders/\n\u2502   \u2502     \u251c\u2500\u2500 t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors\n\u2502   \u2502     \u2514\u2500\u2500 t5xxl_fp16.safetensors \n\u2502   \u2514\u2500 \ud83d\udcc2 vae/\n\u2502            \u2514\u2500\u2500  ae.safetensors\n```\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
